created: 2025-04-09, last updated: 2026-06-06, [Read more](https://blog.logrocket.com/tanstack-start-overview/)

The `app/router.tsx` file configures TanStack Router.
It imports a route tree (which is automatically generated) and allows control for options like scroll restoration.
Add the following to the file and save it:
```
// app/router.tsx
import { createRouter as createTanStackRouter } from '@tanstack/react-router';
import { routeTree } from './routeTree.gen';
export function createRouter() {
const router = createTanStackRouter({
routeTree,
scrollRestoration: true,
});
return router;
}
declare module '@tanstack/react-router' {
interface Register {
router: ReturnType<typeof createRouter>;
}
}
```
